# A hen in view can be pointed at; once the camera looks far away, pointing at it fails the run
# (line 13) rather than moving the pointer outside the window (Q3-15).
set unlock all
set season summer
set clock day
place coop @36,36 0
set camera 36 36 2
fast 60 visible hen 1
set look hen 3
wait 10
move actor:hen
set camera 22 22 3
move actor:hen
quit
